{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And to Moses He said.</b> This passage, until 'all the words of HaShem,' was stated on the fourth day of the month of Sivan, as I explained in the section of Yitro. And according to its plain sense, <b>and to Moses He said</b> — a certain angel, but the verse is defective (elliptic), and there are many like it."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:07.718370543Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}